One sealed packet along with memorandum in Form VII were sent to the office of Public Analyst, Karnal, Haryana whereas two sealed samples were deposited with Local Health Authorities;
that the 2 of 9 CRR-1454-2011 :3:
certificate of Analyst Haryana was received with report that "the month and year upto which the product is best for consumption were not mentioned on the label of the sample, batch number and the month and year in which the commodity is manufactured or pre-paced was also not clearly visible on the label of the sample as required under Rule 32 of PFA Rules, 1955.
